{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"泛闭映射"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"泛闭映射"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的映射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <strong>泛闭</strong> (universally closed) 是指对任意"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":" $Y'\\to Y$, $f'\\colon X\\times_Y Y' \\to Y'$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"闭映射","text":"闭映射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>赋值判别法</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 为概形的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧态射","text":"拟紧映射"}},{"Plain":". 则 $f$ 泛闭当且仅当 $f$ 满足"},{"Local":{"url":"赋值判别法","text":"赋值判别法"}},{"Plain":"中的存在性部分, 即对任意"},{"Local":{"url":"赋值环","text":"赋值环"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 及其分式域 $K$, 提升问题\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}K &amp; \\to &amp; X\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}A &amp; \\to &amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n总<strong>存在</strong>至少一个解.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb A^1_k \\to \\operatorname{Spec}k$ 是闭映射, 但<strong>不是</strong>泛闭映射, 因为其基变换 $\\mathbb A^2_k \\to\\mathbb A^1_k$ 不是闭映射.</p>\n"}]}}